# Lionheart Glimmer: "Whenever you attack, creatures you control get +1/+1 until end of turn." On turn 3 Bot1 attacks with both
# the Glimmer (2/5) and an Ornithopter (0/2): one attack, one trigger, so each of its creatures gets +1/+1 once (not once per
# attacker) - the Glimmer 3/6, the Ornithopter 1/3 - and Bot2's own Ornithopter stays a 0/2. On turn 4 the bonus is gone.
# Before the attack nothing is pumped.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Lionheart Glimmer
Ornithopter
Island x15

[Bot2 Deck]
Ornithopter
Island x19

